## Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Tracked: they hold only a local test database URL and an origin, no secrets.
# Anchored to the exact paths that need it — a bare `!.env.test` un-ignores any
# file of that name at any depth, so a future app's could be staged without
# anyone noticing.
!/apps/api/.env.test
!/apps/web/.env.test